  "description": "PayPal payment channel for the Tnzi.NET payment module: the IPaymentProvider implementation (Orders v2, refunds, webhook verification, Vault v3 account storage and merchant-initiated charges) and the Payment:PayPal options. Load it only when the application actually charges through PayPal; splitting it out also removed the unused PayPalCheckoutSdk reference (and its transitive PayPalHttp) from Tnzi.Payment, so the channel now costs exactly one package and no vendor SDK at all.",
